open(os.path.join(root,'SECURITY_PRODUCTION_V18.md'),'w').write('''# V18 Production Security\n\n- HTTPS: terminate TLS at Nginx using `deploy/nginx.conf`, then set `TRUST_PROXY=1` and `FORCE_HSTS=1`.\n- TURN: run Coturn using `deploy/docker-compose.turn.yml`, replace the placeholder password, expose UDP 3478 and a restricted relay range, then set TURN_URLS/TURN_USERNAME/TURN_CREDENTIAL in `.env`.\n- Never commit `.env`, TURN credentials, or TLS private keys.\n- Use a firewall so Node port 3000 is private/localhost only.\n- Rotate TURN credentials periodically; for stronger deployments use time-limited TURN credentials generated by your TURN provider.\n- Keep the 220-track catalog as links/metadata unless you have distribution rights for audio files.\n''')
